# The lockfile is generated by pnpm, never edited by hand, and is ~7k lines — large enough to
# bury the actual change in any pull request that touches a dependency. Marking it generated
# collapses it in GitHub's diff view and keeps it out of the repository's language stats. It is
# still committed and still reviewed when it matters; it just stops being the first thing you see.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true
